cinnamon-clipboard (1.3.2-1) noble; urgency=medium

  Added:
  * Added info buttons to explain persistent and temporary history modes.

  Fixed:
  * Fixed history-mode info popovers so their descriptions are visible and readable.
  * Correctly recognize release-candidate versions when checking for updates.

